{"id":"95b6dab0b9da8cf0","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Tower Family","display":"df-zfc-comb8-tower-family — ZFC Comb8 Tower Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-tower-family — ZFC Comb8 Tower Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-tower]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-tower-family — ZFC Comb8 Tower Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10c4730632b56f5c\" href=\"?note=10c4730632b56f5c\" title=\"58-df-tower\">58-df-tower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (tower sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (length of tower)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> (indices)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S\\)</span> (tower-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10c4730632b56f5c\" href=\"?note=10c4730632b56f5c\" title=\"58-df-tower\">58-df-tower</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8TowerFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8TowerFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8TowerFamily}_S(T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(T,\\kappa,\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8TowerFamily}_S(T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(T,\\kappa,\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A tower is a strictly mod-finite decreasing sequence of infinite sets with no infinite pseudointersection.</li>\n<li>This classical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-tower specialization now reuses the canonical generalized tower predicate instead of duplicating it with an incompatible cardinal symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tower","status":"resolved","id":"10c4730632b56f5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tower]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tower","status":"resolved","id":"10c4730632b56f5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S$ (tower-sequence predicate, see [[58-df-tower]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8TowerFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8TowerFamily}_S(T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{TowerSequence}_S(T,\\kappa,\\omega)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1165,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1723","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family.md|58-df-zfc-comb8-tower-family]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","10c4730632b56f5c","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}